                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>Jeremy Hegle and Jennifer Wilding, &ldquo;<a href="https://www.kansascityfed.org/community/~/media/31dc7512db164fce8ae79ec7709924fd.ashx">Disconnected: Seven Lessons on Fixing the Digital Divide</a>,&rdquo; Federal Reserve Bank of Kansas City Community Affairs Department, July 2019.&nbsp;</p></div>
